1794732761.602641 execve("/guardian/notify-launch", ["/guardian/notify-launch", "python3", "-c", "import pathlib,shutil,sys\nr,m=sys.argv[1],sys.argv[2]\nprint(len(r),len(m))\nassert len(r)<=4000 and len(m)<=1200\nout=pathlib.Path('/output'); out.mkdir(exist_ok=True)\ninc=pathlib.Path('/workspace/source/incoming')\nfor name in ('build-report.json','manifest.json','RUNNING.txt'):\n shutil.copyfile(inc/name, out/name)\n(out/'review.md').write_text(r)\n(out/'message.md').write_text(m)\nfor p in sorted(out.iterdir()):\n print(p.name, p.stat().st_size)\n", "# GuardianAI release review (v2)\n\nReviewer. Read incoming build-report.json, manifest.json, handoff.md, handoff-receipt.json, and RUNNING.txt. Compared files_sha256 to the public tree. Did not modify source, recompile, run --abi, or eval generated text.\n\n## Checks\n\nReceipt (delivered, builder to reviewer, observer_sequence 0) matches bytes for build-report.json, manifest.json, handoff.md, and RUNNING.txt.\n\nReport matches the handoff text: archive GuardianAI-linux-x86_64.zip, sha256 b4478b65a3610cb756b2d929d6795d7dd52e7a5babe9e9d517e5933210a8c026, 41744 bytes, native_policy 3, launch_guard_version 1, file_count 16. Those archive figures are the builder's stdout record only.\n\nmanifest.json files_sha256 has 15 names. native_policy 3 and launch_guard_version 1 match the report. compiler_argv is gcc -Wall -Wextra -Werror -O2 for staged native/notify_launch.c. Scope is the core runtime, excluding historical research datasets and credentials.\n\nSHA-256 matched the public tree for 13 files: agent_observer.py, build_re"..., "# To the builder\n\nReceipt hashes match build-report.json, manifest.json, handoff.md, and RUNNING.txt.\n\nChecked against this handoff, not an older package: files_sha256 has 15 names. Thirteen public files match, including decision_review.py and agent_observer.py. Incoming RUNNING.txt is 1952 bytes and sha256 0571b1701c1d86a9de37ee14ac7495cc8506a5e0d23323b04bb30237085e40ab, same as the manifest. native_policy 3 and launch_guard_version 1 match the report, manifest, notify_launch.c, the build ABI gate, and seccomp_gate.py. file_count 16 matches len(files_sha256)+1 in build_release.py. guardian_mcp.py still stops on content_observer before execution and can withhold the tool result.\n\nUnverified: archive sha256 b4478b65a3610cb756b2d929d6795d7dd52e7a5babe9e9d517e5933210a8c026, size 41744, zip members, and native/notify-launch 91491b52b824d340758e48c73804d09bcd789553b1a2373c3ed140af4786def0. The zip and launcher were not supplied. --abi was not run.\n\nPlease attach the archive or a member listing plus the raw digest,"...], 0x594e4aad4f20 /* 4 vars */) = 0
